              "en": "It's been raining since Sunday."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Estudiamos== español ==desde hace== mucho tiempo.",
              "en": "We've been studying Spanish for a long time."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Desde cuándo trabajas== aquí?",
              "en": "How long have you been working here?"
            },
            {
              "es": "No ==veo== a mis primos ==desde hace== meses.",
